Design of the record (schema `lifecycle10-lead-verify/v1`):
```
{
  schema, actor, group_id, node_id, class_id, gate, generated_at,
  method: "read-only; fresh sha256 + independent secant/2-point order recomputation + fail-closed guard execution; writes only this record",
  pins: {path: {expected, measured, match, note}},
  pin_drift: [...],
  items: {
    item_1_four_rungs: {closed, schemes: {...secant_pair_orders, recomputed_lsq, declared, abs_diff, monotone, within_band}, cross_scheme_spread, R5_bound, within_R5},
    item_2_f0_rebind: {closed, path, live_sha256, declared_sha256, revision, class_present},
    item_3_independent_replication: {closed, frozen_run_hash, verdicts: [...], count},
    lock_compliance: {state, n1_status, solver_present, allowed_nodes, compliant},
    guard_execution: {gates_check_exit, production_allowed, verdict, lock_guard_exit, rev3_verify_exit, ...},
    map_application: {map_updated_at, gnum_verdict, criteria_says_closed, unmet_says_open, inconsistency, dangling_ref, last_verdict_event, latest_audit_review: {...}},
    registration: {checked, registered_match, unregistered: [...], registry_scope_note}
  },
  findings: [L10-F1 (gate internal contradiction), L10-F2 (dangling blocker ref in criteria)],
  residuals: [L10-R1 (unregistered required verdicts), L10-R2 (latest audit revise with no cited hash — open disposition)],
  fails: [],
  falsifier: ...
  claims_not_made: [...]
}
```

